  "native_engine": "Rhino 8.32.26160.13001 via Wine/FEX on private Xvfb",
  "addition_contract": "Editable sources are converted into the selected instance frame, appended in document order and consumed. Definition/root IDs, placements, root/member attributes, attribute text, geometry text and model groups survive; all target prototype memberships are cleared. Nested sources stay references, and catalog refresh updates all uses and ancestors atomically.",
  "affine_inverse_contract": "Determinant, inverse coefficients and inverse translation are computed from exact rational input doubles and rounded once per output coefficient. Exact singularity, overflow and loss/reversal of rounded inverse orientation reject. Ill-conditioned round-trip accuracy is not certified.",
  "conic_contract": "AddObjectsToBlock applies the public ON_Circle::Transform fitting policy to Circle/Arc sources, retains curve parameter domains and geometry text, and scopes the altered Rust adaptation to this command under third_party/opennurbs-rust. General affine geometry conversion remains exact. Original OpenNURBS notices are retained.",
  "ui_contract": "A single preselected root skips the target getter. Source clicks/windows exclude the target; Enter commits. Empty/invalid source edits keep the getter active. Esc/Cancel restores available original selection without changing geometry or the redo branch. Starting the command again cancels the prior getter before deriving new preselection.",
  "comparison_limits": "Recorded metadata and sampled geometry at absolute 1e-9 plus relative 1e-12. Native captures use command macros and SelID, not pixel mouse/group picking. Local history and UI tests do not establish native selection/history parity. Timings are not kernel performance measurements.",
